0..78 Comment "// The globular theory at dimension one, its associator a stated law, modelled"
79..104 Comment "// by the circle\'s paths."
105..107 Comment "//"
108..182 Comment "// A stated law is the theory\'s generator cell: no rule orients it, and no"
183..255 Comment "// default fills its component. The Path reading is a model of the cells"
256..312 Comment "// reading, so `math.path`\'s associator writes the cell."
313..315 Comment "//"
316..394 Comment "// The model writes the right unit law by conversion and the associator by the"
395..474 Comment "// theorem. A model leaving the associator out has it discharged by `here`: the"
475..519 Comment "// two nestings of a chain of paths convert."
520..522 Comment "//"
523..605 Comment "// - see: `pathological/higher-cells/path-cells.gandr` — a model of the naturals"
606..666 Comment "//   leaving the cell out, and a scope breaking a stated law"
667..741 Comment "// - see: `cat-shape.gandr` — the same theory with its associator a rule"
743..790 Comment "// `assoc`, the associator of path composition."
